  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      247.1,
      541.39,
      367.97
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! The Deep Depression over north Andhra Pradesh coast, moved slowly west-northwestwards and crossed the coast closed to southwest of Kalingapatnam during yesterday, the 23rd September 2026. It then moved West-northwestwards and lay centered at 0000 UTC (05.30 a.m.) of today, 24th September 2026 over northcoastal Andhra Pradesh near latitude 18.3\u00b0Nand longitude 83.7\u00b0E, about 1100 km North-East to Kankasanthurai.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      388.61,
      542.81,
      434.33
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 70kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      438.5,
      541.32,
      480.67
    ],
    "text": "The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase to (55-65) kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough or very rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      499.99,
      542.83,
      826.2
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas bounded by 10\u00b0N to 22\u00b0N latitude and 82\u00b0E to 90\u00b0E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
